# Users and Scope

## Main Users
Student and Young Adults - Inidividuals who want to record expenses, manage budgets, analyse spending patterns and predict future expenses.

## Stakeholders
1. Project Supervisor - Provides guidance and feedback throughout the project development.
2. System Users - Provide the needs and requirements that guide the system development.

## In Scope
- User registration and login.
- Receipt image upload and expense data extraction using OCR.
- Reviewing and editing extracted receipt information.
- Adding, editing, viewing and deleting expense records.
- Monthly budget and spending analysis.
- Displaying spending summaries and visualisations using charts.
- Predicting future expenses using machine learning.
- Spending alerts based on unusual spending patterns.

## Out of Scope
- Mobile application development.
- Direct bank account integration and automatic transactions.
- Investment and loan management.
- Professional financial advice.
- Multi-currency support.